            "body": "I actually thought about adding `<C-n>` and `<C-p>` in default mappings, because muscle memory slipped several times into using them. Thanks for reminder!\r\n\r\nBut to answer your question: yes, of course. You can create an autogroup similar to [this one](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/issues/70#issuecomment-1116459329) but with your own keys.",
